{
  "id": "u15-l06",
  "unit": "u15-describing",
  "title": "Taller than me",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**'Than' is চেয়ে**, after the -র form of what you compare with: **আমার চেয়ে** 'than me', **রাফির চেয়ে** 'than Rafi', **ঢাকার চেয়ে** 'than Dhaka', **ওটার চেয়ে** 'than that one'.\n\nThe adjective never changes, so there is no '-er': **রাফি আমার চেয়ে লম্বা** 'Rafi is taller than me' (literally 'Rafi, than me, tall').\n\nFor people, **বড়** and **ছোট** mean older and younger: **নাদিয়া রাফির চেয়ে দুই বছরের ছোট**. Use **বেশি** 'more' or **কম** 'less' for amounts, and **অনেক** for 'much'.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "cheye",
      "bn": "চেয়ে",
      "tr": "cheye",
      "en": "than",
      "notes": "After the -র form: আমার চেয়ে 'than me', রাফির চেয়ে 'than Rafi'. The adjective doesn't change: ও আমার চেয়ে লম্বা 'he is taller than me'."
    },
    {
      "id": "otar",
      "bn": "ওটার",
      "tr": "otar",
      "en": "of that",
      "notes": "ওটা 'that' + -র: ওটার চেয়ে ভালো 'better than that one'."
    },
    {
      "id": "dhakar",
      "bn": "ঢাকার",
      "tr": "dhakar",
      "en": "Dhaka's; of Dhaka",
      "notes": "ঢাকা + -র: ঢাকার চেয়ে 'than (in) Dhaka'."
    },
    {
      "id": "rafir",
      "bn": "রাফির",
      "tr": "rafir",
      "en": "Rafi's",
      "notes": "রাফি + -র: রাফির চেয়ে 'than Rafi'."
    },
    {
      "id": "bochhorer",
      "bn": "বছরের",
      "tr": "bochhorer",
      "en": "of … years; year's",
      "notes": "বছর + -এর: দুই বছরের বড় 'two years older'."
    }
  ],
